WEBVTT

00:09:58.844 --> 00:10:05.726
(Cheers and applause)

00:10:06.352 --> 00:10:10.648
I moved all of my family's clothes
into one closet off the laundry room,

00:10:10.648 --> 00:10:14.943
and now I just toss things
into organized bins unfolded.

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:21.158
(Cheers and applause)

00:10:21.158 --> 00:10:23.744
My new motto is: “Good enough is perfect.”

00:10:23.786 --> 00:10:28.957
(Laughter and applause)

00:10:28.999 --> 00:10:32.169
And everything worth doing
is worth doing half-assed.